<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Skil Click</Major>
    <Description>Auto using skill with Click on Player without manual pointing. For example you are using Tuna Belly skill from Doram Job, you just push your skill wich is I choose "W" and this macro do automatically for you without you are using your mouse.
You can adjust the position of auto click here depend of your monitor resolution. My screen resolution is 1920x1080.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>varE = 0
GoColor 1 1 156,181,239 255,255,255 1 238 88 993 965 1 0
varE = 1
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 64 ms
MoveTo 990 528
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 500 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Ragnarok</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>